hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15960","Yahya ibn Adam narrated to us, he said, Issam ibn Qudama al-Bajali narrated to us, he said, Malik ibn Numayr al-Khuza'i narrated to me, from his father, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) sitting in prayer, having placed his right forearm on his right thigh, raising his forefinger, having bent it slightly, while supplicating."
"15961","Waki' narrated to us, Issam ibn Qudama narrated to us, from Malik ibn Numayr al-Khuza'i, from his father, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) placing his right hand on his right thigh in prayer, pointing with his finger."
